Built with PS5 React (ps5-react/; its own notices are in ps5-react/NOTICE).

Some code in app/ (the browser capture, its host list, parts of the download queue and of the source labels)
began as code from Overdrive 1.0.6 by MyLuxy (https://github.com/MyLuxy/overdrive), whose capture adapts Orbit
Store by saawant12 (GPL-3.0-or-later). Each of those files says where.

The app switch of the background payload (app/native/bg_downloader.c, POST /switch) reads the kernel message buffer
(kern.msgbuf) for SetControllerFocus/VideoOut lines to know when the old app left the foreground. The idea comes from
ps-game-state-lib by StonedModder (https://github.com/StonedModder/ps-game-state-lib, MIT License); the code is our own.
